# Foudra Print Manager configuration. Root-only (0600): it holds keys.
# The service does not start until MRP_URL and MRP_API_KEY are set.
# After editing:  sudo systemctl restart print-manager
#
# Your Foudra site, and an API key made under its "API keys" page.
MRP_URL=
MRP_API_KEY=
#
# One key per printer, named by its workstation code upper-cased with
# other characters as _. PrusaLink: the API key. OctoPrint: an
# application key. Bambu Lab: the access code from the printer's screen.
#PRINTER_KEY_CORE_ONEP_1=
#
# Optional.
#GCODE_DIR=/var/lib/print-manager/gcode
#POLL_INTERVAL=15s
